== Faroese ==
=== Pronunciation ===
{{IPA|[ˈsʊijan]}}
=== Adverb ===
'''síðan'''
# [[after]], [[afterwards]], [[since]]

====Usage notes====
*[[langur|langt]] '''síðan''' - long time ago
*[[nakað]] '''síðan''' - some time after

=== Conjunction ===
'''síðan'''

# [[since]]

====Usage notes====
*[[tú]] [[ert]] [[vaksin]], '''síðan''' [[eg]] [[sá]] [[teg]] [[síðst]] - you are grown, since I saw you the last time

====Phrases====
*(''kvæði'') '''síðan''' [[eg]] [[eri]] [[deyður]] - (first) when I am dead

=== Preposition ===
'''síðan'''

# [[since]]

====Usage notes====
*'''síðan''' [[kríggj|kríggið]] - since the war

